  "description": "This skid steer pallet fork frame is constructed from heavy-duty grade 50 steel, ensuring exceptional durability and withstanding up to 4,000 pounds of pulling force. You can confidently lift and transport heavy objects with ease.\nFitment\nThis Pallet Fok Frame is compatible with a wide range of skid steers, loaders, and tractors, including models from New Holland, Bobcat, and Kubota. It features a universal skid steer-style quick connect system, allowing for easy and secure attachment.\nCompatible with Universal Skid Steer Quick Attach (SSQA) system.\nFeatures\n[Strong Load-Bearing]: YITAMOTOR skid steer pallet forks boast a powerful bearing capacity of up to 4000lbs; It is an essential agricultural equipment\n[Adjustable Pallet Fork Blades]: The pallet fork blade can be freely moved on the skid steer frame, and the distance can be adjusted within a 17\"-37\" range on the frame\n[Universal Skid Steer Loader Design]: Our design fits virtually all skid steer loaders, loaders and tractors such as New Holland, Bobcat skid steer loaders and Kubota tractors.\n[Lightweight Towing Design]:This frame attachment transforms skid steer loaders into towing vehicles. Equipped with a standard 2-inch trailer hitch, it allows for towing trailers and other tractor implements without impacting the machine's power or lifting capacity.\n[Specifications]: The skid steer fork's total weight: 336lbs, pallet fork blades length: 48\", pallet fork blades width: 4\", pallet fork blades height: 22\"; Package includes: 1x pallet fork frame, 2 x pallet fork blades. Note: Your order may be shipped in 3 packages",
